## Step 10 — Merge Gate Verification
**Time: 2 hours | Run in order**

Run every command, fix any failure before proceeding to the next.

```bash
# 1. Clean install — verify no phantom dependencies
rm -rf node_modules apps/*/node_modules packages/*/node_modules
npm install

# 2. Generate Prisma client from current schema
npm run db:generate

# 3. TypeScript — must be zero errors
npm run typecheck
# If errors: fix them. Do not suppress with @ts-ignore.

# 4. Lint — must be zero errors  
npm run lint
# Common failures: unused imports (the db one), missing return types

# 5. Tests — must all pass
npm run test
# If any test fails: fix the test or the code, not both.

# 6. Full build — all three apps
npm run build
# Any build error is a blocker. No warnings that look like errors.

# 7. Schema validation
cd packages/database && npx prisma validate && npx prisma migrate diff \
  --from-migrations ./prisma/migrations \
  --to-schema-datamodel ./prisma/schema.prisma \
  --exit-code
# Must exit 0. Any diff means schema and migrations are out of sync.

# 8. Security: no secrets in git history
git log --all -S "sk_live" --oneline
git log --all -S "_secret" --oneline  
git log --all -S "password" --oneline | grep -v "test\|mock\|placeholder"
# Must return nothing

# 9. Security: bank details not in API responses
grep -rn "accountNumber" apps/web/app/api --include="*.ts" | \
  grep -v "masked\|hash\|encrypt\|select.*false\|omit"
# Every remaining match must be a field exclusion, not a field inclusion

# 10. Health check against preview deployment
curl https://your-preview.vercel.app/api/v1/health
# Expected: { "status": "ok", "db": "connected", "redis": "connected" }

